license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/docxology/dicklesworthstone_meta_operator"
keywords:
  - git
  - repository-fleet
  - orchestration
  - automation
  - dashboard
  - upstream-sync
abstract: >-
  Meta-operator over a GitHub user's entire repository corpus: clone every
  repo, verify each clone sits on its upstream default branch with a clean
  worktree, orchestrate commands across selector-filtered subsets, build
  per-repo interpretability profiles, and render a static self-contained
  HTML dashboard with a binary health gate.
